, {"speaker": "caller", "start": 85.372, "end": 86.052, "text": "Eh, \u00bfno tiene lata?", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "staff", "start": 86.884, "end": 90.965, "text": "De lata. Karencita, ah, \u00bftienes, um, sodas de lata?", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "staff", "start": 93.186, "end": 94.266, "text": "S\u00ed. S\u00ed, s\u00ed te tenemos.", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "caller", "start": 95.136, "end": 96.597, "text": "Ah, pues unas unas dos de lata, oiga.", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "staff", "start": 98.147, "end": 99.548, "text": "Muy bien. \u00bfAlgo m\u00e1s?", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "caller", "start": 100.539, "end": 101.079, "text": "Ser\u00eda todo.", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "staff", "start": 101.889, "end": 105.23, "text": "Sale, ya con todo y el delivery van a ser 24, \u00bfsale?", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "caller", "start": 106.321, "end": 110.523, "text": "Eh, \u00bfqu\u00e9 le voy a decir? Ah, si quiere le paso mi n\u00famero para que me marquen cuando est\u00e9 afuera, \u00bfno?", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "staff", "start": 110.712, "end": 124.096, "text": "Ah, s\u00ed estar\u00eda bien, no, por favor, esp\u00e9rame, esp\u00e9rame, d\u00e9jame aqu\u00ed guardar este rollo. 24. A ver, \u00bfme dijiste tu nombre otra vez, perd\u00f3n?", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "caller", "start": 113.264, "end": 125.389, "text": "Eh. Jalino. Mm, dos", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "staff", "start": 125.937, "end": 127.217, "text": "Chalino, muy bien, Chalino.", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "staff", "start": 128.858, "end": 139.161, "text": "Y dame tu n\u00famero ahora s\u00ed, Chalino. 2 6 2 2 9", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "caller", "start": 131.571, "end": 132.072, "text": "seis", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "caller", "start": 135.393, "end": 139.694, "text": "dos, dos noventa y cuatro, as\u00ed", "language": "es"}, {"speaker": "staff", "start": 140.241, "end": 140.442, "text": "4. Aj\u00e1.", "language": "es"},